00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:09,220
 That's the plain text.

213
00:12:09,220 --> 00:12:14,640
 So I'll start with U. If it's 1, then I go up, and it's T.

214
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:20,820
 And the second one is P. So I go up, and it's O, T-O.

